Output mfetch.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set WaitTimeout 120s

Hide
Type "rm -rf vendors _mfetch && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "cat >_mfetch<<EOF"
Enter
Type "digestif"
Enter
Type "EOF"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "mfetch"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Wait
Sleep 2s

Type "ls vendors/"
Enter
Wait
Sleep 1.5s

Type "mfetch status"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Wait
Sleep 3s
